RDH Team: Connect with OpsUI to assess the required dependency/change.
RDH Team: Connect with GAE to assess topic/schema and consumption-related changes.
All Teams: Confirm environment availability and readiness.
Follow-up: Schedule a follow-up discussion once the approach is confirmed with AMS.

